                        "entry_id": "61acd059-7cc7-36a9-a0c0-fd7e1d41b1c4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Taking the form of a cream or ointment."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c3be7a03-f7b8-4e2a-9d03-28a9800e0eca",
                                "sense_id": "2096b697-9604-3e46-b156-3896a23acd88",
                                "text": "In vials of ivory and coloured glass / Unstoppered, lurked her strange synthetic perfumes, / Unguent, powdered, or liquid— […]"
